WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.480
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.650
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.700
Four Star Academy is currently consumed by the ongoing S4 Selection.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.830
On day one, Yuzu-senpai took first in Dance Class by a huge margin.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:25.420
On the second day with Theater Class, Tsubasa-senpai remained at the top despite Ako-chan's best efforts.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.460
Then on the third day, Beauty Class provided a surprising twist!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:34.220
Mahiru-chan dethroned Yozora-senpai, claiming the top spot for herself.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.470
And now it's the fourth and final day.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.350
It's finally time to determine who will lead us in Song Class.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.310
Hot!

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.440
I see your tongue is as sensitive as ever.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:52.400
In any case, I wasn't expecting to see you here, Nee-san.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.990
How could I stay away?

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.410
I want to see how my cute successors who conquered their power do.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.160
Good point.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.750
In all likelihood, at the conclusion of today's performances...

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.290
At the conclusion?

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.380
A new legend will be inscribed into Four Star Academy's books.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:57.320
I'm fifty-fifth, right about in the middle.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.860
And I'm...

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:03.870
Right before Hime-senpai.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.990
That's nerve-wracking. {apparently the w is optional}{I remember looking this up way back and it is definitely apparently}

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:11.120
You'll be singing either way, so who cares about the order?

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.500
Y-You're right.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:20.130
You're going up right after me.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:25.890
I feel as though it has been quite some time since last we competed on the same stage.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:29.680
That's because it was! You were off 
recuperating during the hot weather.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:32.900
I've been eagerly awaiting this day that whole time.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.400
Me too.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:37.900
Don't expect me to go easy just because we're friends!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.900
Good. The same goes for me.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.410
Hey, my Song Class babies!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.780
We're about to raise the curtain.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:50.910
Go out there and hit us with your past year's hard work!

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:53.290
I expect you all to be on it!

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.420
Yes!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:21.530
Papa couldn't get out of his overseas recital, but he wishes you the best. {he's a violinist}

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:25.570
Thanks for letting me know. Having you here is more than enough for me.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.160
Rola.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:33.710
You are a Sakuraba, inheritor of our musical lineage.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.040
That is the one thing you must never forget.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:37.790
Yes!

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:44.930
The final day of the S4 Selection with Song Class begins now!

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.440
The results are in.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:00.480
Where does second-year Ashida Yuri place?

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:10.200
Living up to her creds, she leaps through the ranks to first!

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:15.460
Everyone, thank you so much.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:23.920
Ashida Yuri. I've been watching over her since she enrolled, and her growth has been exemplary.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.840
Yes, it was a respectable performance.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:31.180
No outcome would surprise me at this S4 Selection.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:35.100
Oh, goodness. Do those words come from Shiratori Hime-sama's lips?

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.140
Remember what I said?

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:41.820
The goddess of victory is fickle.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.990
Speaking of, where'd Yuzu run off to?

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.910
Isn't that obvious?

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.410
Lilienne!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.580
It's time!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.290
What's wrong?

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:01.460
"Ambitions can never be fulfilled. {then go for it}

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:06.170
The further one reaches, the more that falls from already within their grasp." {a quote from whoever リヒトヴェーア is}{lichtwer, also I would have gone with ambition but I don't will re}{okay, I think this conjures an image of chasing two birds and getting none}

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:09.090
Oh, sounds like today's proverb!

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:15.730
I have always endeavored not to aspire for more than I require.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:21.110
My long-held wish of establishing my own brand has already been fulfilled.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:27.650
But now, I am driven by new ambitions.{at least consistent it}{you got it}

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:33.030
I want to join S4 and don a Premium Rare Dress of my own creation

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.170
and sing alongside you more.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.330
You can definitely do it, Lilienne!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:45.710
Use your Tundra Diva power to encase the whole hall in ice!

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:46.840
I will!

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:57.600
I will set off for a new dream, clad in my beloved dress.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:02.860
Shirogane Lily, pouring my soul into this moment!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.100
She's done it!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:26.640
She's knocked Ashida Yuri off the top spot!

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:34.780
Nice Aikatsu.

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.780
Thank you.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.280
You know, it's strange.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.910
I can't bring myself to feel disappointed.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:50.080
We enrolled the same year, but you always had to take time off.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:55.340
Back when we competed for that CD debut, I pretty much won by default.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:58.050
Finally...

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:05.010
Congrats, Lily.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:16.530
Hands off! The honor of celebrating Lilienne's win first goes to Yuzu-sama!

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.030
Sorry, sorry.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.860
Yuzu is the childhood friend here!

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.530
I said I was sorry, okay?

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.290
Just let it slide.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.080
<i>Thanks, you two.</i>

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:29.160
I won't forgive you!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.410
You're so stubborn.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.120
I am not!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.170
Seeing them as classmates is so nice.{yuzu's not in the same class but there isn't really much can do}

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.590
We have our work cut out for us.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.090
Rola?

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.180
Th-That's right.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.510
Let's go.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:47.350
Sure.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:53.310
<i>She wasn't simply amazing.</i>

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:57.820
<i>Lily-senpai put so much more of her soul into that song than ever before.</i>

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:04.410
<i>No, it's more like her soul itself hit me from the stage.</i>

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:07.700
<i>But I...</i>

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:25.720
And that wraps up the first half of Song Class!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:29.850
Shirogane Lily maintains her hold on the top spot.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:34.230
The second half will come at you right after a half-hour break.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:38.860
Everyone in the venue, if you've got anything to do, get on it quick!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.700
Where did Rola go?

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.950
What's going on?

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:50.740
Oh, hey. I figured Rola might've been thirsty too.

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:56.630
She must be feeling the pressure trying to match my glorious performance.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.710
I think not.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:02.920
I could feel it when we shared the stage before.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.880
Rola is strong! Both mentally and physically.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.010
Yeah, she is!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.780
What's wrong, Sakuraba?

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:25.360
Oh... nothing.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:29.870
Don't be concerned about winning or losing. Just walk your own path.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.160
Isn't that what you decided to do?

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:38.880
I did, but Lily-senpai's performance has got me worried all over again.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.540
About what?

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:48.720
"Going my way". But in the end, I'm just copying Lily-senpai.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:14:04.070
Sakuraba. You've thought more deeply and more seriously about song than anyone else in your year.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.610
I haven't really...

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:08.860
Now then!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.450
I'd say it's about time.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:16.580
Get out there and show me what your "This is Sakuraba Rola" is about! {she turns this into her new thing}{I long for the days of scoops and mics...}

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.210
Right!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.670
<i>This is... Sakuraba Rola!</i>

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.550
Rola?

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.970
Where've you been?

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.230
Oh, around.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.640
Hey, Rola.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:50.280
Let's do it!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:52.780
Aikatsu!

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:53.780
Ouch!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.580
Hey, that hurt, Yume!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.000
Did it loosen you up?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.920
Huh?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.290
Let's let it all out, Rola! {considered go wild}{consider it no longer}

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.050
Yume...

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:09.800
I want to see you perform without anything held back!{someone was excited}

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.390
You've got it, Yume.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.230
Thank you. I finally feel free!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.230
Rola, what are you doing? 
Come on, you're about to be up!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.690
Got it!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:25.730
All right, see you after!

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.110
Rola, hurry up!

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.030
Okay!

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:34.620
<i>Why did I start worrying all of a sudden?</i>

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:37.450
<i>Being with Yume drew the best out of me.</i>

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.330
<i>There were times when I cried and felt lost.</i>

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.840
<i>But in the end, we always smiled together!</i>

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:49.630
<i>Now I just need to put this whole year's emotions into song!</i>

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:54.260
<i>Into a song that's mine, a song that I love!</i>

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:58.100
<i>That's right, this song comes from my way of life.</i>

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.770
<i>This is Sakuraba Rola!</i>

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:07.360
<i>The Aqua Starry Rock Coord.</i>

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:12.910
<i>Each scattered star contains my passion for singing.</i>

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:16.580
<i>The melody inside me is out of control. {directly from her song}</i>

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:21.660
Sakuraba Rola—it's my time to shine!

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.820
Where does that place Sakuraba Rola?

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:45.530
Th-This is...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:50.540
What a surprise! She beat out the second-year admins!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:55.040
First-year Sakuraba Rola stands atop the ranking, baby! {whoa, I was too excited I miseed the baby}

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:59.510
I did it!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.550
You've found your answer.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:09.470
That's what makes you a daughter of the Sakuraba family, Rola.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.270
You pushed through, Sakuraba.

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:17.440
Your passion reached us through your song.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:22.610
See, Hime? The goddess of victory isn't so fickle after all.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:23.450
Huh?

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:28.450
She smiles upon those who put in the effort.{this isn't what prince of tennis told me}

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.960
Yes, you're absolutely right.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:35.580
Lilienne worked really hard too!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:41.130
We understand. I tried my hardest as well, but I still lost to Mahiru.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.340
But there is a reason.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.590
There is?

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:50.430
The effort they devoted to take a step in a new direction exceeded ours.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:54.350
Sh—Sh-Sh-She won!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.060
Rola beat Lily-senpai!

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:58.230
Whoa...

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.230
Girls!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.650
You did it, Rola!

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:03.070
That was splendid!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:05.570
It was a seriously fantastic performance!

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:06.530
Thanks!

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.740
I did it, Yume!

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:15.370
Who cares about my score? I've never felt this good singing in my entire life!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.370
Rola...

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:20.250
I was finally able to sing in my own voice!

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:25.380
Sakuraba-san, congratulations.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:29.970
Were it my dear Anne of Green Gables, she would say:

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:33.350
"Now there is a bend in it.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:42.360
I don't know what lies around the bend, 
but I'm going to believe that the best does."

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:49.120
You have stepped forth onto a path that is truly yours alone, and nobody else's.

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.790
Thank you!

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:02.710
That's my Lilienne!

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.130
Whether it ends in tears or smiles, this is it. {is... this a thing? if not: whether it ends}{you can say "be it X or Y, Z", but not this monstrosity}{I am a monster ;_;}

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:15.510
Yume-chan, come at me with everything you've got!

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:18.890
Right! Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:24:18.890 --> 00:24:20.850
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:22.730
Be the First Star!

00:24:22.730 --> 00:24:24.650
Become the first-star idol! {...talk about shooting yourself in the foot}{talk about using an inappropriate idiom}{it is appropriate. I'll shoot you too to be sure}
